From 2d451a92d02902b6cffc2ac2d491fcaa64077ec9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: broody <broody@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 13:50:11 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] Port Templar's bounded-memory PCS mode onto this stwo,
 with a circuit-prover entry point

Owned trees keep coefficients instead of expanded evaluations and are
regenerated one tree at a time for opening (root checked); FRI quotients are
accumulated max_fri_columns columns at a time. Storage policy only: a new
circuit-prover test checks bounded proofs equal unbounded ones on both
profiles. Three-way merge of bench/bounded-memory/stwo.patch (runtime files;
the unused streamed-Merkle API is left out) from stwo 489a0f3.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
